  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hola, me llamo Thelo y estoy recorriendo\nel mundo en busca de Pokémon poco comunes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este de aquí se llama Gimmighoul.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007300740065002000640065002000610071007500ED0020007300650020006C006C0061006D0061002000470069006D006D006900670068006F0075006C002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gimmiii!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470069006D006D00690069006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo atrapé haciendo turismo por Paldea.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F00200061007400720061007000E9002000680061006300690065006E0064006F002000740075007200690073006D006F00200070006F0072002000500061006C006400650061002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo malo es que, para que evolucione, hacen falta\nMonedas de Gimmighoul.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas monedas. Exactamente...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007500630068006100730020006D006F006E0065006400610073002E0020004500780061006300740061006D0065006E00740065002E002E002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡999!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1003900390039002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero aquí en Ciudad Luminalia no he encontrado\nni una.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F002000610071007500ED00200065006E00200043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610020006E006F00200068006500200065006E0063006F006E0074007200610064006F000A006E006900200075006E0061002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por favor, ayúdame! Yo te doy a mi Gimmighoul\ny tú haces que evolucione y me lo enseñas, ¿vale?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vale, dámelo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006C0065002C0020006400E1006D0065006C006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sé yo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007300E900200079006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vaya panda de estirados que sois aquí en esta\nciudad! ¡Es un favor de nada!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que tienes las cajas llenas. Libera algún\nPokémon y luego vuelve, anda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Genial! ¡Llévatelo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470065006E00690061006C0021002000A1004C006C00E90076006100740065006C006F002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido un Gimmighoul.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F00200075006E002000470069006D006D006900670068006F0075006C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido 413 Monedas de Gimmighoul.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F00200034003100330020004D006F006E0065006400610073002000640065002000470069006D006D006900670068006F0075006C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora haz que evolucione, por favor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068006F00720061002000680061007A0020007100750065002000650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0065002C00200070006F00720020006600610076006F0072002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Llévate también unas monedas que conseguí\nreunir en Paldea.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006C00E90076006100740065002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200075006E006100730020006D006F006E0065006400610073002000710075006500200063006F006E007300650067007500ED000A007200650075006E0069007200200065006E002000500061006C006400650061002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando hayas conseguido que evolucione,\nven a enseñármelo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNecesitarás reunir 999 Monedas de Gimmighoul.\n¡Buena suerte!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando hayas conseguido que Gimmighoul\nevolucione, ven a enseñármelo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0064006F00200068006100790061007300200063006F006E007300650067007500690064006F0020007100750065002000470069006D006D006900670068006F0075006C000A00650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0065002C002000760065006E0020006100200065006E0073006500F100E10072006D0065006C006F002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Has conseguido hacer evolucionar a\nGimmighoul? ¡A ver, a ver! ¡Enséñamelo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Huala... ¡Cómo brilla! ¡Voy a necesitar gafas de\nsol!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800750061006C0061002E002E002E002000A1004300F3006D006F0020006200720069006C006C00610021002000A10056006F0079002000610020006E00650063006500730069007400610072002000670061006600610073002000640065000A0073006F006C002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ya sé que es un poco abusar, pero...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C0020007900610020007300E9002000710075006500200065007300200075006E00200070006F0063006F0020006100620075007300610072002C0020007000650072006F002E002E002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Dame ese Gholdengo, por favor te lo pido!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100440061006D00650020006500730065002000470068006F006C00640065006E0067006F002C00200070006F00720020006600610076006F00720020007400650020006C006F0020007000690064006F002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vale, toma",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006C0065002C00200074006F006D00610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí que es abusar...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED00200071007500650020006500730020006100620075007300610072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, ya, lo sé... Déjalo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C002000790061002C0020006C006F0020007300E9002E002E002E0020004400E9006A0061006C006F002E00100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me dedicaré a reunir monedas para conseguir\na mi propio Gholdengo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00650020006400650064006900630061007200E9002000610020007200650075006E006900720020006D006F006E00650064006100730020007000610072006100200063006F006E007300650067007500690072000A00610020006D0069002000700072006F00700069006F002000470068006F006C00640065006E0067006F002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Genial!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470065006E00690061006C002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Con Gholdengo a mi lado, parece que brillo con\nluz propia!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E002000470068006F006C00640065006E0067006F002000610020006D00690020006C00610064006F002C002000700061007200650063006500200071007500650020006200720069006C006C006F00200063006F006E000A006C0075007A002000700072006F007000690061002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me has hecho un favor grandísimo.\n¡Te lo agradezco en el alma!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000680061007300200068006500630068006F00200075006E0020006600610076006F00720020006700720061006E006400ED00730069006D006F002E000A00A1005400650020006C006F0020006100670072006100640065007A0063006F00200065006E00200065006C00200061006C006D0061002100100002011401C10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias a ti, he podido añadir a Gholdengo a\nmi equipo. ¡No lo olvidaré nunca!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Go, go, go!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10047006F002C00200067006F002C00200067006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Algún día lograré que mi Gimmighoul evolucione.\n¡Ya lo verás!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
